 versión diferent','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Instalada · compilada pa una versión diferent, a nueva versión ha fallau','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Instalada · creata pa una versión diferent, versión nueva programata','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Instalada · creada pa una versión diferent, traducindo a nueva versión…','Installed · built for a different version; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Instalada · feita pa una versión diferent; este plugin u tema ya no ye cubierto por o plan de servicio d\'o puesto','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'L\'almagazena o proveedor d\'alochamiento d\'o servicio y la procesan modelos d\'IA ta chenerar a traduzión.','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Mantener as mías propias substitucions de traduccion quan se purgue tot u se desinstale este plugin.','Language'=>'Idioma','Language:'=>'Idioma:','Languages'=>'Idiomas','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Idiomas trobatos en iste puesto: %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Zaguera limpieza o %1$s: %2$d recientment marcau(s), %3$d fichero(s) borrau(s), %4$d rechistro(s) eliminau(s).','Maintenance'=>'Mantenimiento','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'L\'estato d\'o mantenimiento no ye disponible en iste inte.','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifiesto no disponible: %s','Negation reversed'=>'Negación invertida','No'=>'No','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'No i hai garra compilación disponible ta descargar ta esta configuración regional.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Encara no s\'ha executau garra limpieza.','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Garra component coincide con estos filtros. %s','No components synced yet.'=>'Encara no s\'ha sincronizato garra componente.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Garra traducción instalada coincide.','No language is managed yet.'=>'Encara no se chestiona garra idioma.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'No bi ha garra desafío pendient pa este nonce.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'No bi ha garra desafío pendientta verificar.','No plugins or themes found.'=>'No s\'han trobato plugins ni temas.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'No bi ha garra compilación anterior á la que tornar.','No record for %s'=>'No bi ha cap rechistro de %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'No bi ha garra ID de puesto rechistrau pa rotar un token.','No — component inactive'=>'No — component inactivo','No — component removed'=>'No — component eliminato','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'No: a versión instalata ye diferent d\'a activa','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'server_build_id no válido: %s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'No cubierta por el plan de servicio gratuito','Not installed'=>'No instalada','Not registered yet'=>'Encara no rechistrato','Not supported'=>'No compatible','Not verified'=>'No verificato','Note (optional)'=>'Nota (opcional)','Nothing to choose.'=>'No bi ha cosa que trigar.','Nothing to confirm.'=>'No bi ha cosa que confirmar.','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Desactivato per defecto: eliminar o plugin conserva a identidat d\'este puesto, de forma que una reinstalación puede reutilizar-la.','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Un u más fichers servius ya no coinciden con o manifiesto.','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Compra unica ta este puesto: %1$s %2$s. Incluye todas as actualizacions futuras de traduccions. O pago lo chestiona Paddle en una pestanya nueva.','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Nomás un administrador d\'a rete puede fer esto, ya que modifica fichers de traduccion compartius por tot os puestos web d\'esta rete.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Nomás se pueden empaquetar plugins y temas.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Nomás quan confirmes una pujata d\'un plugin u tema que no ye en WordPress.org: tot os ficheros .php y .js, tot os ficheros block.json, y readme.txt, readme.md, style.css y theme.json d\'a carpeta principal d\'ixe component, como un zip, dimpués d\'excluir os ficheros que coincidan con secretos habituals.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Ubrir os achustes de Babilim','Original language'=>'Idioma original','Original string'=>'Cadena orichinal','Paid'=>'De pago','Partner'=>'Socio','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Comprebe que se puede acceder a o tuyo puesto dende internet y torne a intentar-lo.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Tría una categoría ta iste informe.','Plugin'=>'Plugin','Plugin · %s'=>'Plugin · %s','Plugins'=>'Plugins','Preview'=>'Vista previa','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Compra restaurada. Este puesto web ya tien licencia.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'O numero d\'entradas analizadas de nuevo no coincidiba con l\'indice construyiu.','Re-verify'=>'Tornar a verificar','Rebuild index now'=>'Reconstruir l\'indice agora','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Se refusa escribir difuera d\'o directorio de ficheros d\'idioma de Babilim.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'A respuesta de rechistro no teneba os campos obligatorios.','Registration restarted.'=>'Rechistro reiniciau.','Remove'=>'Quitar','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Eliminar tot o que Babilim ha instalato','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Eliminar tot o que Babilim ha instalato? Isto borra todos os ficheros d\'idioma que ha instalato ta cada plugin y tema d\'iste sitio.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Sacar d\'este puesto a traduccion de %1$s en %2$s?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'S\'ha eliminau %d componente instalau.' . "\0" . 'S\'han eliminau %d componentes instalaus.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Eliminau dimpués d\'una verificación d\'integridat fallida','Removed.'=>'Eliminau.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Elimina totz os ficheros d\'idioma que Babilim ha instalau pa cada plugin y tema d\'este puesto web.','Report a problem'=>'Informar de un problema','Report translation'=>'Informar traducción','Request newer translation'=>'Solicitar una traducción más recient','Request translation'=>'Solicitar traducción','Requestable'=>'Solicitable','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Demandar una traduzión mete iste plugin u tema en uno d\'os cupos d\'o plan de servicio gratuito pa este puesto (o limite ye %1$d pa temas y %2$d pa plugins), si no ye que ya n\'tienga uno. Un cupo queda en uso y una traduzión fallida no lo libera.','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Demandar una traduzión mete iste plugin u tema en uno d\'os cupos d\'o plan de servicio gratuito pa este puesto, si no ye que ya n\'tienga uno. Un cupo queda en uso y una traduzión fallida no lo libera.','Requesting…'=>'Solicitando…','Restart registration'=>'Reiniciar o rechistro','Restore code'=>'Codigo de restauración','Restore purchase'=>'Restaurar a compra','Retry request'=>'Reintentar solicitut','Roll back'=>'Tornar ta enrere','Roll back and report'=>'Tornar ta enrere y informar','Roll back and send report'=>'Tornar enta zaga y ninviar informe','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'Tornar a la compilación anterior d\'a traduccion %2$s de %1$s?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Revertiu e informau.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'S\'ha tornau á la compilación anterior.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'S\'ha tornato enta zaga, pero no s\'ha puesto ninviar l\'informe: %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Revertir sobrescribiría \'%1$s\' (%2$s), que agora se sirve ta atro componente instalau (%3$s); no s\'ha cambiau cosa.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'A la respuesta de rotación d\'o token le faltaba site_token.','Save changes'=>'Alzar os cambios','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Programau, asperando a ser procesau','Search'=>'Buscar','Search components'=>'Buscar componentes','Search the installed translations'=>'Buscar en las traducciones instaladas','Select all'=>'Seleccionar tot','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Tría menos componentes: como maximo %1$d operacions por execución (has triau %2$d).','Send report'=>'Enviar informe','Service plan'=>'Plan de servicio','Settings'=>'Ajustes','Share error reports'=>'Compartir informes de errores','Share this report'=>'Compartir este informe','Show a new restore code'=>'Amostrar un codigo de restauración nuevo','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Amostrar l\'entrada «Informar traducción» en a barra de ferramientas d\'administración','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Una parte d\'o texto d\'este componente ye escrito dreitament en o codigo por o suyo autor y no puede estar traduciu por un paquete de idioma.','Status'=>'Estau','Status unknown'=>'Estato desconoixito','String context'=>'Contexto de la cadena','Suggested translation'=>'Traducción sugerita','Supplementary translation index'=>'Índice suplementario de traduccions','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'S\'ha reconstruyito l\'índice de traduccions suplementarias.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Mantenimiento de traduccions complementarias','Supplementary translations'=>'Traduccions complementarias','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'L\'analís s\'ha cancelau sin deixar cosa orfena: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Análisis completado: %d fichero eliminau.' . "\0" . 'Análisis completado: %d ficheros eliminaus.','Sweep now'=>'Analizar agora','Sync complete.'=>'Sincronización completada.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Gracias. O tuyo informe s\'ha ninviau.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ixe componente no ye instalau en este puesto, per tanto no se puede demandar una traducción pa el.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Esto no pareix un codigo de restauración.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Ixe no ye un codigo de configuración regional de WordPress valido. No s\'ha alzato cosa.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Ixe no ye un identificador de compilación valido.','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'Ixa pantalla de carga yera desafechada: dende entonzes s\'ha preparato una carga diferent. No s\'ha ninviato cosa. Revisa la actual dende a Lista de Translations.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'No s\'ha puesto rechistrar o cambio en l\'índice de traducions; tornar a intentar-lo.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'A limpieza s\'ha executau, pero no s\'han puesto rechistrar qualques cambios suyos en l\'índice de traduccions; a proxima limpieza tornará a intentar rechistrar-los.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'O componente no tiene fichers que se puedan pujar.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'O component no ye dentro d\'o directorio de plugins u de temas.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'No s\'ha trobato o fichero prencipal d\'o component.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'A la respuesta de descarga li faltaba una ubicacion utilizable.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'L\'entrada ubre un panel pa mirar as traduzions que Babilim ha instalato en iste puesto y informar d\'una d\'ellas.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'O campo "%1$s" ye masiau largo: tiene %2$d caracters y o limite ye %3$d. No s\'ha ninviau cosa; acorta-lo y torna a intentar-lo.','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'O plan de servicio gratuito da a cada puesto un numero limitato de cupos pa plugins y temas; os cupos en uso se amuestran en Settings dimpués d\'activar Babilim.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'O dominio endicau \'%1$s\' no coincide ni con o slug propio d\'o manifiesto d\'o paquete \'%2$s\' ni con o suyo text_domain \'%3$s\'.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'L\'indice combinato de \'%s\' s\'ha reconstruyito, pero l\'indice de traduccions no ha puesto rechistrar-lo; a proxima reconstruccion lo tornará a intentar.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'O texto orichinal y as traduccions feitas a partir d\'ell se proporcionarán a atros sitios que instalen a mesma versión.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'O paquet no declara garra fichero de traduzión prencipal.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'O paquete no tien %s ta o suyo propio dominio de texto.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'O tipo \'%1$s\' d\'o manifiesto d\'o paquete no coincide con o tipo demandato \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'O paquete no ha produciu garra fichero de traduccion prencipal servible.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'O dominio de texto d\'o paquete \'%1$s\' no coincide con a copia d\'o component d\'este puesto web (\'%2$s\'), per ixo no s\'ha instalato.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'No s\'ha puesto leyer o componente empaquetau.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'O desafío de rechistro no tiene o formato esperau.','The report could not be sent.'=>'No s\'ha puesto ninviar l\'informe.','The search could not be completed.'=>'No s\'ha puesto acabar a busca (Buscar).','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'O servicio ha demandau á este puesto que aguarde antes de tornar a sincronizar.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'O servicio no ha puesto acceder a o tuyo puesto. Ye probable que un cortafuegos, un plugin de seguridat u una regla de l\'alochamiento estié bloqueyando a solicitut; permite as solicitutz a /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'L\'oferta de puyada d\'o servicio yera incompleta.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'O dominio de texto \'%1$s\' (%2$s) ya se sirve ta atro componente instalau (%3$s); no s\'ha instalau cosa.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'A puyata se conserva dica que le pidas a Babilim que la elimine.','Theme'=>'Tema','Theme · %s'=>'Tema · %s','Themes'=>'Temas','There is no upload in progress.'=>'No bi ha garra pucha en curso.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'No bi ha garra pucha asperando confirmación.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Istos son os idiomas que usa iste puesto. Puetz cambiar-los en %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'S\'ninviarán istos campos:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Esta compilación no ye una que este puesto conoixca actualment pa este componente y configuración rechional.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Este componente no declara un numero de versión, per tanto no se puede demandar una traducción pa el.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Este componente ye mas gran d\'o que acepta o servicio, per tanto no se puede puyar.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Iste component ya s\'ha puyato. Babilim lo está comprebando agora.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'O numero de versión d\'iste component tien mas de %d caracters, cosa que Babilim no puede procesar, per ixo no se puede demandar una traducción ta él.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Esto emite un codigo de restauración nuevo y o anterior deixa de funcionar. Continar?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Esta rete tien masiaus puestos pa comprebar-los uno a uno, y ye posible que bell unos sigan configuraus pa borrar a suya identidat de Babilim cuan se elimine o plugin. A licencia de pago asociada a un puesto asinas no podría restaurar-se automaticament; haurías de contactar con o Soporte de Babilim en %s. Pa conservar as identidats, preta Cancelar, desmarca «Eliminar todos los datos de Babilim al desinstalar» en os ajustes de Babilim de cada puesto y torna a desactivar. Desactivar de totz modos?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'A versión d\'este plugin, pa que o servicio puega dizir-te que l\'actualices si ye masiau viello pa comunicar-se con él.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Este informe no endica un plugin u tema y una configuración rechional validos.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Este informe no indica garra cadena instalada.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'A iste informe le falta una compilación valida ta informar.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Iste informe se publicará publicament en GitHub y puede estar conservato per tercers.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Este codigo de restauración no s\'ha reconoixiu ta este puesto.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Iste puesto ya tiene un rechistro activo que ya no se puede recuperar automaticament.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Este puesto tien %1$d componentes en %2$d idiomas, o que requiere %3$d lotes de comprebación; Babilim puede gestionar como maximo %4$d por execución. Reduz os idiomas gestionaus en Ajustes u desactiva os plugins y temas que no uses, y dimpués preta Comprobar de nuevo agora.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Iste sitio no tiene garra compra ta la que amostrar un codigo.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Este puesto web ya tiene licencia. Recarga la pachina.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Este puesto encara no ye rechistrato en Babilim.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Este puesto sobrepasa o tamanyo que o servicio acepta en una sincronización, por ixo s\'han omitiu bell elementos: %1$d componentes y %2$d configuracions regionals.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Este puesto fa parte d\'una rete multisitio, que no instala automaticament traduccions nuevas. As traduccions que ya son instaladas se i siguen esviellando.','This site is verified.'=>'Este puesto ye verificau.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Primero s\'ha de verificar este puesto.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'A URL d\'iste puesto, ta que o servicio pueda verificar que ye suyo.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'A adreza d\'iste puesto ye masiato larga ta que Babilim la pueda rechistrar.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'A configuración regional d\'este sitio.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'O codigo de configuración rechional d\'este puesto no ye uno que Babilim pueda rechistrar.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Ista cadena no se puede informar dende iste puesto.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Esta cadena no ye entre as traducions instaladas en este puesto. Buscar de nuevo y trigar-la d\'a lista.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Esta traducion s\'actualizó dimpués d\'a tuya busqueda. Buscar de nuevo y trigar a cadena d\'a nueva lista.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Pa traduzir este component, Babilim necesita o suyo codigo fuent.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Masiatos intentos. Torna a prebar-lo manyana.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Masiatos informes güei. Tornar a provar_ doman.','Too many requests.'=>'Masiadas peticions.','Toolbar'=>'Barra de ferramientas','Translating…'=>'Traducindo…','Translation does not load'=>'A traduccion no se carga','Translation failed'=>'Error en a traduccion','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Os fichers de traduccion que meta en %s tienen siempre prioridat sobre os de Babilim. Se conserban an menos que desmarques ista opción.','Translation requested.'=>'Traducción solicitada.','Translations'=>'Traduccions','Type'=>'Tipo','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Escribe a lo menos 2 caracters ta buscar.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Respuesta HTTP %d inesperada.','Uninstall'=>'Desinstalar','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Tipo desconoixito: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Dominio no seguro: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Configuración regional no segura: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug no seguro: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain no seguro: %s','Update'=>'Actualizar','Update available'=>'Actualización disponible','Updates'=>'Actualizacions','Updating…'=>'Actualizando…','Upgrade this site'=>'Mejorar este puesto','Upload and request'=>'Puyar y solicitar','Upload cancelled.'=>'Puyada cancelada.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Puyada completada: traducción solicitada.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'A pujada ha caducau antes d\'acabar','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Pujata en curso: continar u cancelar','Upload this component?'=>'Puyar este component?','Upload was not accepted'=>'No s\'ha acceptato a puyata','Uploading'=>'Puyando','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Puyando a parte %1$d de %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Puyando…','Verified'=>'Verificato','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'A respuesta de verificación no teneba site_token.','Version %s'=>'Versión %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Qué s\'ninvía cuan s\'activa Babilim','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Quan bella cosa falle dintro de Babilim, ninvia un informe d\'errors t\'o Servicio de Babilim pa que se puiga publicar como una incidencia publica en GitHub. L\'informe se ninvia como si venise d\'iste puesto, con a mesma autenticación que tot atra solicitut t\'o Servicio de Babilim. O servicio nomás publica o codigo d\'error y as versions como incidencia publica en GitHub; la incidencia publica no conten l\'adreza d\'o puesto, contenius ni rutas de Fichero. Per defecto, desactivato.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Án has visto isto (opcional)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Entre que esta opción ye activada, as traduzions que o servicio indica como disponibles pa las luengas que administras s\'instalan durante a sincronización dos begadas a o día.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Incorrecto pa iste contexto','Wrong meaning'=>'Significau incorrecto','Wrong plural form'=>'Forma plural incorrecta','Wrong term'=>'Termín incorrecto','Yes'=>'Sí','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'No tiens permiso ta fer ixo.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'A tuya versión de PHP, por compatibilidat.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'A tuya versión de WordPress, ta ofrir fichers de traducion compatibles.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'O tuyo nuevo codigo de restauración: %s. Guarda-lo en un puesto seguro: o codigo anterior ya no funciona.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'O tuyo informe lo tratan automaticament models d\'AI y puede millorar ista traduccion pa atros puestos.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'O tuyo puesto web ha respondiu, pero no con o que s\'asperaba. Puede estar que unatro plugin reescriba l\'API REST u que ixe endpoint estié en caché; excluye /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge d\'a caché y d\'a reescritura.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'O tuyo puesto ha tardato masiato en responder. Tornar a intentar-lo mas tarde y comprebar que o tuyo alochamiento no sía masiato lento ni sobrecargato.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'O zip no contién manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Ta o zip li falta o fichero per defecto esperato: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Ta o zip li falta o fichero esperau: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json tiene una estructura inasperada','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'no s\'ha puesto leyer _manifest.json: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest no tien o campo \'%s\' u ye invalido.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'O campo \'server_build_id\' d\'expected_manifest no ye un ID de compilación valido.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'no s\'ha puesto analizar _manifest.json: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'deixaría orfens %1$d de %2$d componentes chestionaus (más d\'a metat)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'deixaría orfens totz os componentes de tipo %1$s chestionaus (%2$d de %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Discrepancia en o numero d\'entradas de l10n.php de %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json tien un \'default_domain_entries\' no valido.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json tien un \'default_domain_files\' no valido.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json d\'o zip no ye un JSON valido.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'A manifest.json le falta o campo \'%s\' u no ye valido.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'Falta manifest.json u tien un \'build_no\' invalido.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json no tien \'entries\' u ye invalido.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'A manifest.json le falta \'extra_domains\' u no ye valido.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json no tien \'files\' u ye invalido.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'O campo \'%s\' de manifest.json no coincide con a valor asperada.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'O campo \'contract\' de manifest.json no ye una cadena de versión valida.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'O campo \'kind\' de manifest.json ha d\'estar \'plugin\' u \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'O campo \'server_build_id\' de manifest.json no ye un ID de compilación valido.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'O campo \'status\' de manifest.json ha d\'estar \'published\'.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce ha de estar una cadena hexadecimal.','per day'=>'al día','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'Discrepancia de sha256 en %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'Discrepancia de sha256 en default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plugin','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'tema','problem report categoryOther'=>'Atro','translation statusAvailable'=>'Disponible','translation statusInstalled'=>'Instalada','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Traducción de Babilim desactivada.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Deixar d\'usar a traducción de Babilim','Use Babilim translation'=>'Usar la traducción de Babilim','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'¿Deixar d\'usar la traduzión de Babilim de %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress usará en cambio la traduzión propia d\'o tema u la traduzión de WordPress.org. Puetz tornar a cambiar en qualsequier momento.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'¿Deixar d\'usar la traduzión de Babilim de %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress usará en cambio la traduzión propia d\'o plugin u la traduzión de WordPress.org. Puetz tornar a cambiar en qualsequier momento.','Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes'=>'Babilim – Traducir automaticament plugins y temas','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'Te fa goyo Babilim? Deixa una valoración en WordPress.org.','Rate Babilim'=>'Valorar Babilim','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'Traducción de Babilim incluyida con o tema','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'Traducción de Babilim incluyida con o plugin','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Per cada plugin y tema instalato: o suyo nombre (slug), versión, text domain, si ye listato en WordPress.org, as luengas que ya incluye y quals d\'ixas traduccions incluyidas ha chenerato Babilim (nomás codigos de luenga). Per cada Traducción de Babilim que tiengas instalata: qué versión ye, quán s\'a comprebato per zaguera vegata y si ha superato a suya verificación de ficheros.']];